          ":question/problem": "Find the entry ${r}_{43}$ of the matrix $R$, where \n\n$$\nR=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & 2 & \\sqrt{3} & 4 \\\\ -3 & 0 & -4 & 5 \\\\ 5 & -2 & 8 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 1 & \\sqrt{2}\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$",
